arly Access playable beta build to players with a VR native mode for players with the Oculus Rift Headset and a standard view mode for normal monitors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/317080/extras/12a3a92dcabc74cd306d578698938f5b.avif?t=1447362991\" width=600 height=224 /></span>",
